e:["$","span",null,{"children":"The episode moves between New York, where “Dixie” was first performed; Montgomery and New Orleans, where Confederate patriotic music spread; Baltimore and the 1862 Maryland Campaign; Chicago’s major music publishers; Virginia army camps; and Georgia during Sherman’s 1864 campaign."}]
